(ns kotoba.netcap.tls-fixtures
  "TEST-ONLY PKI for kotoba.netcap.tls (generated 2026-09-25 with OpenSSL 3.6.3,
  EC P-256, valid 100 years). The private keys here protect nothing: they exist
  so a loopback handshake can be run on both hosts. The CA key was discarded.

    ca        CN=kotoba netcap test CA (the trust anchor)
    server    CN=localhost, SAN DNS:localhost only (no IP SAN, on purpose:
              connecting to 127.0.0.1 must fail hostname verification)
    client    CN=kotoba test client, clientAuth (mTLS), issued by ca
    other     self-signed CN=localhost, SAN DNS:localhost, NOT issued by ca")

